    "ai_summary": {
      "id": 891926,
      "summarized_text": "A Shopify product CSV import left some items missing, including Meyer Lemon Olive Oil, even though the error email identified other rows whose products appeared in the store. The email reported titles exceeding Shopify’s 255-character limit and a duplicate “Sampler (30 mL)” variant; the original poster could not identify why the Meyer Lemon item was absent.\n\nThe latest reply separates these into distinct issues: shorten the overlong titles, and remove or change the duplicate variant for the same product handle and option combination. For Meyer Lemon Olive Oil, it recommends searching by exact handle and SKU, checking Draft and Archived products and product status, and looking for rows that may have merged under a similar or repeated handle. It also advises verifying required fields and using a plain decimal price.\n\nThe suggested next step is to correct the known errors, then test-import only the Meyer Lemon rows with overwrite enabled and review the resulting error email. The cause of the missing product has not been confirmed, and no successful re-import is reported.",
